/**
 * Puzzle catalog for standard sizes.
 *
 * puzzle-nonograms.com does not generate puzzles client-side. "New Puzzle"
 * fetches JSON from `/get?prevID=…` with a Conceptis-style `task` string
 * (~50% density, multi-segment clues). We mirror that profile locally via
 * {@link generatePuzzleForSize}, and seed a few live-sampled `task` strings
 * solved by the same logic engine.
 */

